## Production Connection Pooling with PgBouncer & Serverless Tuning

In serverless or highly concurrent container environments, each app instance opening its own connection pool quickly exhausts PostgreSQL connection limits (`max_connections`). Deploying PgBouncer in transaction pooling mode allows thousands of concurrent clients to multiplex over a lean pool of 20-50 physical database connections.

